ion was about we were  talking about different policies kanye's  obviously a very visionary thinker he's  somebody who  cares a lot about about our country and  a lot of people  we were discussing a book that he  actually sent me a while ago called  powernomics by dr claude anderson which  is  uh which had a lot of great policy ideas  in it many of which the president's put  in place but  look president trump promised that he  would be the president for  all americans and especially represent  the forgotten americans  in this country president trump led  historic efforts to pass criminal  justice reform i was  uh fortunate to lead those efforts which  rolled back uh the crime laws  that were passed in 1994 that had a  disproportionate impact on the  african-american community  he also passed opportunity zones to get  access to capital  in a lot of the underserved areas and so  right now we're in the pandemic but a  lot of these ideas for how we can get  better schools and better capital and  better jobs into the inner cities to  those  who need it the most are ones that  president trump's very focused on so  kanye and i like to talk about ideas  like that but uh we haven't discussed  his actual campaign you didn't discuss  his campaign for president at all  uh we did not jared kushner thank you  very much  great thank you have a great day

